    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/4586d82603af3a2aea29c37220b1fb17.avif?t=1755224580\" width=500 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Make History.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One man fights for himself. One man fights for all.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be one of the first to experience <strong>Eternal</strong>, an intoxicating journey into the nature of humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/4077d4e45608d9db219fea0f2cb5aba4.webp?t=1755224580\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/f3b5d84608b08794ab2966e478ea938a.poster.avif?t=1755224580\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/f3b5d84608b08794ab2966e478ea938a.webm?t=1755224580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/f3b5d84608b08794ab2966e478ea938a.mp4?t=1755224580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Eternal</strong> is a ground-breaking fully-animated cinematic masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219 100 Steam Achievements <br>\u2219 Collectable Character Cards <br>\u2219 In-Game Snapshots <br>\u2219 Single-player &amp; Local Multiplayer Fighting Game <br>\u2219 Director's Commentary <br>\u2219 Character Library <br>\u2219 SRPG Tactics Game <br>\u2219 Art Gallery <br>\u2219 Hidden Comedy Scenes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/4077d4e45608d9db219fea0f2cb5aba4.webp?t=1755224580\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>100% compatible for play on Steam Deck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended settings and troubleshooting:  <br>\u2219 Steam Menu \u2192 Settings \u2192 Display \u2192 Put Deck to sleep \u2192 Sleep after 20 minutes or more (for longer story scenes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219 Troubleshooting any game startup issues:\u00a0 Uninstall game, reinstall, hold power button down to force shutdown of Steam Deck at end of game download (if necessary; skip if unnecessary), power on again, go to\u00a0game settings \u2192 Properties \u2192 Installed files \u2192 Verify integrity of game files, allow it to reacquire missing files,\u00a0start game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219 We released a major update that vastly improved the game loader on 8/14/25, but which required starting a new game save for any game saves <i>before</i> that date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/4586d82603af3a2aea29c37220b1fb17.avif?t=1755224580\" width=500 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Make History.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One man fights for himself. One man fights for all.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be one of the first to experience <strong>Eternal</strong>, an intoxicating journey into the nature of humanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/4077d4e45608d9db219fea0f2cb5aba4.webp?t=1755224580\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/f3b5d84608b08794ab2966e478ea938a.poster.avif?t=1755224580\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/f3b5d84608b08794ab2966e478ea938a.webm?t=1755224580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/f3b5d84608b08794ab2966e478ea938a.mp4?t=1755224580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Eternal</strong> is a ground-breaking fully-animated cinematic masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219 100 Steam Achievements <br>\u2219 Collectable Character Cards <br>\u2219 In-Game Snapshots <br>\u2219 Single-player &amp; Local Multiplayer Fighting Game <br>\u2219 Director's Commentary <br>\u2219 Character Library <br>\u2219 SRPG Tactics Game <br>\u2219 Art Gallery <br>\u2219 Hidden Comedy Scenes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043810/extras/4077d4e45608d9db219fea0f2cb5aba4.webp?t=1755224580\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>100% compatible for play on Steam Deck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended settings and troubleshooting:  <br>\u2219 Steam Menu \u2192 Settings \u2192 Display \u2192 Put Deck to sleep \u2192 Sleep after 20 minutes or more (for longer story scenes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219 Troubleshooting any game startup issues:\u00a0 Uninstall game, reinstall, hold power button down to force shutdown of Steam Deck at end of game download (if necessary; skip if unnecessary), power on again, go to\u00a0game settings \u2192 Properties \u2192 Installed files \u2192 Verify integrity of game files, allow it to reacquire missing files,\u00a0start game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219 We released a major update that vastly improved the game loader on 8/14/25, but which required starting a new game save for any game saves <i>before</i> that date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Make History. One man fights for himself. One man fights for all. Be one of the first to experience Eternal, an intoxicating journey into the nature of humanity. Eternal is a ground-breaking fully-animated cinematic masterpiece. 100% Compatible with Steam Deck Gamepad.",
